    "id": "assetGroupDesign",
    "name": "AssetGroupDesign",
    "description": "An Asset Design Group represents an abstract definition of an asset group, generally, when an engineering drawing exists for a particular asset assembly - that would be the \"design\". Generic asset can be associated to products, as just an asset design group. Asset design groups themselves, do not get inventoried, they do not have maintenance performed against them. ",
